# Barcha matn fayllari repoda va ishchi papkada LF bilan.
# Sabab (2026-11): Windows'da core.autocrlf=true bilan `git archive`
# docker-entrypoint.sh ni CRLF bilan chiqardi → konteynerda
# "docker-entrypoint.sh: No such file or directory" va API ishga tushmadi.
# .sql ham muhim: Prisma qo'llangan migratsiyalar checksum'ini solishtiradi.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh  text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
